    "data": [
        {
            "title": "比特幣徘徊84,000美元附近，國債收益率上升抵銷監管進展",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"比特幣徘徊84,000美元附近，國債收益率上升抵銷監管進展\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"540\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/c0549ae9f127f250cb913ab137068ea2b63d7860d63359c75ab791f9bc6a2bfa/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fcontent-media.investing.com%2Fnews%2FLYNXMPEBBM0M5_M.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">比特幣徘徊84,000美元附近，國債收益率上升抵銷監管進展</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><strong>Investing.com -</strong> 比特幣在週末前夕維持在84,000美元附近，儘管機構需求與監管進展提供一定支撐，但美國國債收益率的持續攀升仍對這一加密貨幣形成壓力。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">截至美國東部時間凌晨00:55（北京時間12:55），比特幣報83,981.2美元，當日跌幅約0.27%。本週早些時候，比特幣曾跌破83,000美元，但於週五短暫回升至85,000美元附近。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">債券市場是當前最主要的壓力來源。週五，10年期美國國債收益率攀升至5.2%以上，創下2007年以來的最高水平，令固定收益資產的吸引力相對上升，並對比特幣及其他風險資產形成打壓。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-33cbc3fb-30ca-32cb-b1dd-3762505925dc-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">機構資金流入則提供了一定的對沖力量。截至週三，美國現貨比特幣交易所交易基金（ETF）在連續五個交易日內合計吸引約26.5億美元資金流入，其中僅週三一天便錄得約3.47億美元。貝萊德（BlackRock）旗下的IBIT與富達（Fidelity）旗下的FBTC貢獻了當天大部分的資金淨流入。</p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[94px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[94px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow hidden h-[94px] w-[300px] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:block\"></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Strategy（NASDAQ:MSTR）是目前持有比特幣最多的上市公司，該公司正積極拓展其與比特幣掛鉤的融資模式。公司提議對四種優先股實行每日股息累計，認為更頻繁的派息安排有助於提升相關證券的流動性與市場需求。一旦優先股需求增強，Strategy便可獲取更多資本用於進一步購入比特幣。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">監管方面的進展則呈現喜憂參半的局面。美國證券交易委員會（SEC）委員海絲特·皮爾斯（Hester Peirce）長期以來力主為加密貨幣行業制定更清晰的監管規則，她曾主導SEC加密貨幣工作組，並參與推動有關質押、代幣分類及代幣化證券的相關工作。然而，她將於10月2日正式離任。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">她的離任恰逢華盛頓另一次立法受挫——美國參議院未能推進《數字資產市場清晰法案》。與此同時，區塊鏈協會（Blockchain Association）首席執行官薩默·梅爾辛格（Summer Mersinger）亦宣布卸任，前任領導人克里斯汀·史密斯（Kristin Smith）將以臨時CEO身份回歸。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">在美國以外，德國擬議中的加密貨幣稅務改革引發新的憂慮。根據相關計劃，若投資者無法提供可信的資產取得成本記錄，稅務機關可能以加密貨幣出售所得的50%作為替代評估基準來計算應繳稅款，此舉已遭到Circle高管帕特里克·漢森（Patrick Hansen）的公開批評。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">就比特幣當前的週末格局而言，強勁的機構資金流入與持續的企業採用趨勢，正與高企的國債收益率及揮之不去的監管不確定性形成角力。</p><h2 class=\"mb-module-gap leading-[1.35] text-px22 font-bold lg:text-px24 text-batcave\"><strong>今日加密貨幣行情：週末前夕山寨幣小幅走高</strong></h2><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">根據最新市場數據，週六早盤整體加密貨幣價格小幅上揚。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">全球市值第二大加密貨幣<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"以太幣（Ether）\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:以太幣（Ether）;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://hk.investing.com/crypto/ethereum/eth-usd?utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_campaign=yahoo-hk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">以太幣（Ether）</a>上漲0.35%，報2,689.67美元。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">全球市值第三大加密貨幣<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"XRP\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:XRP;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://hk.investing.com/crypto/xrp/xrp-usd?utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_campaign=yahoo-hk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">XRP</a>上漲1.55%，報1.5566美元。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"Solana\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:Solana;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://hk.investing.com/crypto/solana/sol-usd?utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_campaign=yahoo-hk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Solana</a>上漲3.64%，報120.67美元；<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"BNB\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:BNB;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://hk.investing.com/crypto/bnb/bnb-usd?utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_campaign=yahoo-hk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">BNB</a>則微漲0.12%，報774.28美元。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"卡爾達諾（Cardano）\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:卡爾達諾（Cardano）;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://hk.investing.com/crypto/cardano/ada-usd?utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_campaign=yahoo-hk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">卡爾達諾（Cardano）</a>上漲3.39%，報0.2565美元；<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"狗狗幣（Dogecoin）\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:狗狗幣（Dogecoin）;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://hk.investing.com/crypto/dogecoin/doge-usd?utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_campaign=yahoo-hk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">狗狗幣（Dogecoin）</a>則上漲3.05%。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">迷因幣方面，<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"TRUMP\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:TRUMP;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://hk.investing.com/crypto/maga/trump-usd?utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_campaign=yahoo-hk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">TRUMP</a>下跌1.31%，而<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"柴犬幣（Shiba Inu）\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:柴犬幣（Shiba Inu）;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://hk.investing.com/crypto/shiba-inu/shib-usd?utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_campaign=yahoo-hk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">柴犬幣（Shiba Inu）</a>則上漲2.60%。</p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E6%AF%94%E7%89%B9%E5%B9%A3%E5%BE%98%E5%BE%8A84-000%E7%BE%8E%E5%85%83%E9%99%84%E8%BF%91-%E5%9C%8B%E5%82%B5%E6%94%B6%E7%9B%8A%E7%8E%87%E4%B8%8A%E5%8D%87%E6%8A%B5%E9%8A%B7%E7%9B%A3%E7%AE%A1%E9%80%B2%E5%B1%95-055437420.html",
